### Do the TSD RECEIVE:                                                 00680000
                                                                        00690000
```                                                                     00700000
INMR901I Dataset TCC021.CMC.LOADPDSE from TCC021 on N1                  00710000
INMR902I Members: VUECERTS                                              00720000
INMR154I The incoming data set is a 'PROGRAM LIBRARY'.                  00730000
INMR906A Enter restore parameters or 'DELETE' or 'END' +                00740000
                                                                        00750000
 IEBCOPY MESSAGES AND CONTROL STATEMENTS                      PAGE     100760000
 IEB1135I IEBCOPY  FMID HDZ3310  SERVICE LEVEL UJ96518  DATED 20250108  00770000
 DFSMS 03.01.00 z/OS    03.01.00 HBB77E0  CPU 3932                      00780000
 IEB1035I LBDYCK   TSOPROC  TSOPROC  07:37:24 FRI 12 DEC 2025 PARM=''   00790000
  COPY INDD=((SYS00124,R)),OUTDD=SYS00123                               00800000
 IEB1013I COPYING FROM PDSU  INDD=SYS00124 VOL=WORK0B                   00810000
 DSN=SYS25346.T073724.RA000.LBDYCK1.R0104983                            00820000
 IEB1014I  TO PDSE OUTDD=SYS00123 VOL=CBTU02 DSN=LBDYCK1.CMC.LOADPDSE   00830001
 IGW01551I MEMBER VUECERTS HAS BEEN LOADED                              00840000
 IGW01550I 1 OF 1  MEMBERS WERE LOADED                                  00850000
 IEB147I END OF JOB - 0 WAS HIGHEST SEVERITY CODE                       00860000
 INMR001I Restore successful to dataset 'LBDYCK1.CMC.LOADPDSE'          00870000
 ```                                                                    00880000
